From 8d639c3ba3c5c10e889a991c39509b96df9a6977 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TDVP Build <build@tdvp.local>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:40:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wpewebkit: include Wasm type conversion in B3 validator

JavaScriptCore's B3 validator checks the scalar type for WebAssembly SIMD
lane operations.  The checks call Wasm::toB3Type() through argument-dependent
lookup, but B3Validate.cpp no longer gets the declaration transitively on the
RISC-V WPE build path.

Include the defining header directly.  This is an include-hygiene fix: it does
not change WebAssembly code generation or any runtime behaviour.

---
 package/wpewebkit/0001-b3validate-include-wasm-type-definition.patch | 25 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 25 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 package/wpewebkit/0001-b3validate-include-wasm-type-definition.patch

diff --git a/package/wpewebkit/0001-b3validate-include-wasm-type-definition.patch b/package/wpewebkit/0001-b3validate-include-wasm-type-definition.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..42c6f9e620
--- /dev/null
+++ b/package/wpewebkit/0001-b3validate-include-wasm-type-definition.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+From 4d8a8f1493707689bff28c5048d3db09ded6db2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: TDVP Build <build@tdvp.local>
+Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:40:00 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH] JavaScriptCore: include WasmTypeDefinition in B3Validate
+
+B3Validate uses Wasm::toB3Type for SIMD lane validation.  Include its
+declaration directly rather than depending on an incidental transitive
+include, which is absent in the RISC-V configuration.
+
+---
+ Source/JavaScriptCore/b3/B3Validate.cpp | 1 +
+ 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
+
+diff --git a/Source/JavaScriptCore/b3/B3Validate.cpp b/Source/JavaScriptCore/b3/B3Validate.cpp
+index 808650daaaf..7320b782cf0 100644
+--- a/Source/JavaScriptCore/b3/B3Validate.cpp
++++ b/Source/JavaScriptCore/b3/B3Validate.cpp
+@@ -45,6 +45,7 @@
+ #include "B3Variable.h"
+ #include "B3VariableValue.h"
+ #include "B3WasmBoundsCheckValue.h"
++#include "WasmTypeDefinition.h"
+ #include <wtf/HashSet.h>
+ #include <wtf/StringPrintStream.h>
+ #include <wtf/text/CString.h>
